---
// Content from CLAUDE.md — Hero Copy section
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-blue via-dark-blue to-brand-blue py-12 md:py-24 lg:py-32 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle background texture -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="grid" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl pt-8 md:pt-0">
      <p class="font-montserrat text-cyan text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
        Florida Home Tips
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-montserrat text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Simple Home Tips for<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-cyan">Florida Living</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-base md:text-xl mb-7 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Protect your home from humidity, mold, storms, and pests&nbsp;— without wasting money.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a
          href="/checklist"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-cyan text-dark-blue font-montserrat font-bold text-sm md:text-base rounded-xl hover:bg-vivid-cyan transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Download the Free Checklist
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 16.5v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75V16.5M16.5 12 12 16.5m0 0L7.5 12m4.5 4.5V3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/blog"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/30 text-white font-montserrat font-semibold text-sm md:text-base rounded-xl hover:border-cyan hover:text-cyan transition-all duration-200"
        >
          Browse All Guides
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
